  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Child Labor and Forced Labor in the Coffee Supply Chain in Honduras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will help businesses establish systems to prevent, detect and eliminate child labor and other forms of labor exploitation from their supply chains, and will assemble a powerful coalition of coffee buyers to collectively incentivize compliance among suppliers. In doing so, the project will help promote supply chains free of exploitative labor and a fair playing field for workers in the U.S. and around the world.</narrative>
  </description>
